## 3. Key Architectural Decisions
- Project Name: TrueGaze
- Native Output: TrueGaze.dll
- Mod Title: True Gaze — Biological NPC Gaze & Kinematics
- SDK Toolchain: CommonLibSSE-NG with C++20 and CMakePresets.json
- Dual-Mode Architecture:
  * Mode 1 (Autonomous Edge): Standalone in-engine C++ kinematics running at 60-144 FPS for all NPCs and creatures.
  * Mode 2 (Connected HCEP): Asynchronous Windows Named Pipe (`\\.\pipe\TrueGazeBridge`) streaming live player gaze & HCEP mode from D:\Projects\HCEP to Skyrim for true bi-directional mutual gaze.
- Bone Distribution:
  * NPC Spine2: 10% yaw
  * NPC Neck [Neck]: 25% yaw/pitch
  * NPC Head [Head]: 65% yaw/pitch
  * Eye Nodes: 100% instant ballistic saccade + VOR counter-rotation

